OL,3,AI was spending #700 a month: How I beat
OL,4,Amy late-night shopping addiction
OL,5,
OL,6,FYou may well have been there. It's
OL,7,Flate, you're scrolling on your phone
OL,8,Fand suddenly feel a strong urge to buy
OL,9,Fsomething - only to wake up the next
OL,10,Fday and regret it.
OL,12,FBut what happens when those impulse
OL,13,Fbuys become a habit rather than a
OL,14,Fone-off?
OL,16,FOne global study suggests 7% of adults
OL,17,Fexperience shopping addiction - an
OL,18,Funcontrollable urge to spend despite
OL,19,Fthe financial consequences - and
OL,20,Fyounger women are more susceptible.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
