OL,3,AI was spending #700 a month: How I beat
OL,4,Amy late-night shopping addiction
OL,5,
OL,6,FElla Hewitt, from Liverpool, says her
OL,7,Fshopping addiction got so bad in 2021
OL,8,Fthat she was spending up to #700 a
OL,9,Fmonth on fast fashion she couldn't
OL,10,Fafford and sometimes never even wore.
